      "notes": "The same vulnerable package (lodash 4.17.15) appears in two manifests (a, b); manifest c pins a clean version. An engine must report two occurrences with distinct manifest paths, and none for c. This is the input that exposes how dependency identity merges or splits across manifests (gap G3, ADR-014).",
